{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-26","kind":"proposition","title":"三角形全等：两角和对应边相等","englishTitle":"If two triangles have the two angles equal to two angles respectively, and one side equal to one side, namely, either the side adjoining the equal angles, or that subtending one of the equal angles, they will also have the remaining sides equal to the remaining sides and the remaining angle to the remaining angle.","book":1,"number":26,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.26","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.26/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":26,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","contentId":"euclid-1-26","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9841fdc7a0c0614640e1a9882199a2de329c90b45335661e9448f019dec0c808","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-26.statement","euclid-1-26.construction.1","euclid-1-26.proof.1","euclid-1-26.proof.2","euclid-1-26.construction.2","euclid-1-26.proof.3","euclid-1-26.proof.4","euclid-1-26.proof.5","euclid-1-26.proof.6","euclid-1-26.proof.7","euclid-1-26.construction.3","euclid-1-26.proof.8","euclid-1-26.proof.9","euclid-1-26.proof.10","euclid-1-26.proof.11","euclid-1-26.proof.12","euclid-1-26.conclusion","euclid-1-26.historical.1","euclid-1-26.historical.2","euclid-1-26.historical.3","euclid-1-26.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-26.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f9868d58fce229ec430ed11eae7607c346a5ddce7f7bc56236e41f0d7ec9da7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two triangles have the two angles equal to two angles respectively, and one side equal to one side, namely, either the side adjoining the equal angles, or that subtending one of the equal angles, they will also have the remaining sides equal to the remaining sides and the remaining angle to the remaining angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个三角形的两角度分别等于两个角度,而一面等于一面,即或平行角的一方,或以一个相等角度的子方,则其余方与剩余方的相等,其余方则与剩余角的相等。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形有相当之两角等及相当之一边等则馀两边必等馀一角亦等其一边不论在两角之内及一角之对"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个三角形有两个相等的角和相等的边，那么另外两条边也必须相等，剩下的角也相等。不管一条边是在两个角之间还是在一角对面，"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6fea30aa0176ffbb4cdf1ec7cb461f8af1795211dbd7036a0f2d6286aaaf9c3c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be two triangles having the two angles ABC, BCA equal to the two angles DEF, EFD respectively, namely the angle ABC to the angle DEF, and the angle BCA to the angle EFD; and let them also have one side equal to one side, first that adjoining the equal angles, namely BC to EF;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC、DEF成为两个三角形,两个角ABC、BCA分别等于两个角DEF、EFD,即ABC至DEF,BCA至EFD;让它们也有一个对等面,首先是对等角BC至EF;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"860ccea0408ca488f2077425e1e5e2b5e73eec6891c7354a6d3097c10c5199ad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that they will also have the remaining sides equal to the remaining sides respectively, namely AB to DE and AC to DF, and the remaining angle to the remaining angle, namely the angle BAC to the angle EDF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,它们还将使其余双方分别与其余双方,即AB至DE和AC至DF等值,并使其余方与其余方,即BAC至EDF等值。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7df9f151a4b097018b8109042fd8c56136a7293e4e3d308770f615c7d3fabcba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if AB is unequal to DE, one of them is greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果AB是不平等的,DE, 其中有一个更大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71cac4a41a3034204404a647bcb1c4d427bc658f9eeaf0261dc63a54ee4a75fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be greater, and let BG be made equal to DE; and let GC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB变得更大,让BG达到DE;让GC连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3aee28155041d2e07398831d5da87d453c06ca58d820d3366ddfb47b307832da","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since BG is equal to DE, and BC to EF, the two sides GB, BC are equal to the two sides DE, EF respectively; and the angle GBC is equal to the angle DEF; therefore the base GC is equal to the base DF, and the triangle GBC is equal to the triangle DEF, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles, namely those which the equal sides subtend; [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] therefore the angle GCB is equal to the angle DFE. But the angle DFE is by hypothesis equal to the angle BCA; therefore the angle BCG is equal to the angle BCA, the less to the greater: which is impossible. Therefore AB is not unequal to DE, and is therefore equal to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,由于BG等于DE,BC至EF,双方GB,BC等于双方DE,EF;GBC角等于DEF角;因此,底边,GC角等于底边,DF角,三角形GBC等于DEF角,其余角等于其余角,即平等方所向下角;因此,GCB角等于DFE角。因此,角度BCG等于角度BCA,数量小于较大数量:这是不可能的。 因此,角度AB不等于DE,因此等于它。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3376c025009c76dd1a0b00e03b7341686f45c803adb4f7c639899870508ae0a7","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BC is also equal to EF; therefore the two sides AB, BC are equal to the two sides DE, EF respectively, and the angle ABC is equal to the angle DEF; therefore the base AC is equal to the base DF, and the remaining angle BAC is equal to the remaining angle EDF. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BC也等于EF;因此,双方AB、BC等于双方DE、EF,ABC角等于DEF角;因此,底边 AC等于底边 DF角,其余BAC等于其余的EDF角。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f703a712e2148f5a8c122dd83bb93885a74cb8f38bbfd469f10644a947baf575","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let sides subtending equal angles be equal, as AB to DE;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的,让以等角度进行分解的两面相等,即AB至DE;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"86336540e87cdabd1e2010261b802f6ebc88fddf641fda5aa4a048eb6c766338","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say again that the remaining sides will be equal to the remaining sides, namely AC to DF and BC to EF, and further the remaining angle BAC is equal to the remaining angle EDF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我再次指出,其余双方将等于其余双方,即AC至DF和BC至EF,另外,其余的BAC角等于其余的EDF角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"946b612edfc356e2af27edc391875c3c2b4e1a247db7c5dc5c0c1e15be4bebaf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if BC is unequal to EF, one of them is greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果BC是不平等的,EF, 其中有一个更大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":10,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c8e798766be8adf2ed8663fa231b24869ccbaef381100307154e9f7c5ddf6769","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let BC be greater, if possible, and let BH be made equal to EF; let AH be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,让我们把BC增加到BC,让BH增加到EF;让AH连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d7e771c81572e192abda682a67483cffce7b60c8b50f7d456a52937919123bd7","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since BH is equal to EF, and AB to DE, the two sides AB, BH are equal to the two sides DE, EF respectively, and they contain equal angles; therefore the base AH is equal to the base DF, and the triangle ABH is equal to the triangle DEF, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles, namely those which the equal sides subtend; [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] therefore the angle BHA is equal to the angle EFD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,由于BH等于EF,AB至DE,双方AB、BH等于DE,EF,它们包含相同的角度;因此,底边 AH等于底边 DF,三角形ABH等于三角形DEF,其余角度将等于其余角度,即平等方所向下的角度;因此,BHA等于EFD。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b7fd4b04dbbbf1894e3530532da1fb994acc88bf05ea165901a8923c8c36322","citations":["euclid-1-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle EFD is equal to the angle BCA; therefore, in the triangle AHC, the exterior angle BHA is equal to the interior and opposite angle BCA: which is impossible. [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度EFD等于角度BCA;因此,在三角形AHC中,外部角度BHA等于不相邻的内角BCA:这是不可能做到的。 [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"970eed7787c415d678e3b1c337685e4d2a0c50ecb956307a73ad4ede8af74de2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BC is not unequal to EF, and is therefore equal to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BC项并不属于EF项,因此与这项权利相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"27eeef4b2845a4e7ebc8192267b3246536b21744cb0bdca53a36af5f59447c16","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB is also equal to DE; therefore the two sides AB, BC are equal to the two sides DE, EF respectively, and they contain equal angles; therefore the base AC is equal to the base DF, the triangle ABC equal to the triangle DEF, and the remaining angle BAC equal to the remaining angle EDF. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB也等于DE;因此,双方AB,BC等于双方DE,EF,它们包含同等角度;因此,底边,AC等于底边,DF,三角形ABC等于三角形DEF,其余角度BAC等于其余角度EDF。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":16,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad79f485279a013a9fe44e5272ecebbc3eb8f811ba04b664f888f7a0742b25af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形有相当之两角等及相当之一边等则馀两边必等馀一角亦等其一边不论在两角之内及一角之对先解一边在两角之内者曰：甲乙丙角形之甲乙丙甲丙乙两角与丁戊己角形之丁戊巳丁巳戊两角各等在两角内之乙丙边与戊巳边又等题言甲乙与丁戊两边甲丙与丁巳两边各等而乙甲丙角与戊丁巳角亦等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个三角形有两个相等的角和相等的边，那么另外两条边也必须相等，剩下的角也相等。不管一条边是在两个角之间还是与一个角配对，先解决一条边在两个角之间的问题：甲乙丙，三角形甲乙丙甲丙乙和丁戊己的两个角，三角形丁戊巳丁巳戊的两个角，每一对角都相等，并且位于两个角之间的边乙丙和戊巳也相等。命题说明：甲乙和丁戊，甲丙和丁巳的边各自相等，并且乙甲丙和戊丁巳的角也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":18,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a295772f8117827917c3215c252637dad69be4a9569ae671bac7c882a9c0cc6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如云两边不等而丁戊大于甲乙令于丁戊线截取庚戊与甲乙等〈本篇三〉次自庚至己作直线即庚戊巳角形之庚戊戊巳两边宜与甲乙乙丙两边等矣夫乙角与戊角元等则甲丙与庚巳宜等〈本篇四〉而庚巳戊角与甲丙乙角宜亦等也〈本篇四〉既设丁己戊与甲丙乙两角等今又言庚己戊与甲丙乙两角等是庚己戊与丁己戊亦等全与其分等矣〈公论〉〈九〉以此见两边必等两边既等则馀一角亦等后解相等边不在两角之内而在一角之对者曰：甲乙丙角形之乙角丙角与丁戊己角形之戊角丁己戊角各等而对丙之甲乙边与对己之丁戊边又等题言甲丙与丁己两边丙乙与己戊两边各等而甲角与戊丁己角亦等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：如果两边不相等且 丁戊 大于 甲乙，则在 丁戊 行，取 庚戊 和 甲乙 等。〈本篇三〉 然后从 庚 到 己 画一条直线，即三角形 庚戊巳 的两边应等于 甲乙乙丙 的两边。如果 乙 和 戊 的角相等，则 甲丙 和 庚巳 应相等，〈本篇四〉 和 庚巳戊 及 甲丙乙 也应相等。由于假设 的角相等，现在说 庚己戊 和 甲丙乙 相等，则 庚己戊 和 丁己戊 也相等 〈公论〉〈九〉 由此可以看出，两边必须相等。如果另一个角相等，则另一个角也相等。下一种解法是：如果边不在两角之间而位于一角对面，则说：三角形 甲乙丙 的 乙 角和 丁戊己 角都相等，而 丙 的 甲乙 边和 己 的 丁戊 边也相等。命题说明：甲丙 和 丁己 的两边相等，丙乙 和 己戊 的两边相等，甲 和 戊丁己 的角也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":19,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2b96101b3a28b3191840ee6b8a4110225c4786664c077fc26abc6bab6ecc789c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如云两边不等而戊己大于乙丙令于戊己线截取戊庚与乙丙等〈本篇三〉次自丁至庚作直线即丁戊庚角形之丁戊戊庚两边宜与甲乙乙丙两边等矣夫乙角与戊角元等则甲丙与丁庚宜等〈本篇四〉而丁庚戊角与甲丙乙角宜亦等也既设丁巳戊与甲丙乙两角等今又言丁庚戊与甲丙乙两角等是丁庚戊外角与相对之丁巳戊内角等矣〈本篇十六〉可乎以此见两边必等两边既等则馀一角亦等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：如果两边不相等且 戊己 大于 乙丙，则在 戊己 行，戊庚 和 乙丙 以及 〈本篇三〉 从 丁 到 庚 画一条直线，即三角形 丁戊庚 的两边应等于 甲乙乙丙。如果 乙 和 戊 的角相等，则 甲丙 和 丁庚 应相等。〈本篇四〉, 并且 丁庚戊 和 甲丙乙 也应相等。由于 丁巳戊 和 甲丙乙 相等，现在又说 丁庚戊 和 甲丙乙 相等，因此 丁庚戊 的外角等于 丁巳戊 的内角。〈本篇十六〉 可接受。由此可见，两边必须相等，因此两边相等时，剩余的角也应相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-26.source","contentId":"euclid-1-26","revisionId":"euclid-1-26@raw-9841fdc7a0c06146","order":20,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ac6eb52467c880229fb5eb950510c5c74f2e2d95ede65c3fe494bcaef2aca365","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"gen